<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/flipped-classroom> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An instructional approach that moves direct content delivery outside class time and uses shared face-to-face time for more interactive learning activities." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/flipped-classroom/versions/1> .
